          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: संभाव्य",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संभाव्य — sambhāvya — \"likely; potential\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संभाव्य धोका लक्षात घेऊन शाळा बंद ठेवल्या. sambhāvya dhokā lakṣāt gheūn śāḷā band ṭhevalyā. Keeping the possible danger in mind, the schools were kept closed."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Invariable; संभाव्यता, probability."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संभाव्य (sambhāvya) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit sambhāvya, \"possible, probable\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
