              "text": "बहुधा — bahudhā — \"probably; most likely\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बहुधा उद्या पाऊस पडेल. bahudhā udyā pāūs paḍel. It will probably rain tomorrow."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Often first in the sentence, before the guess: बहुधा (bahudhā) तो येईल."
            }
          ]
        },
