          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बहुधा (bahudhā) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit bahudhā, \"in many ways\" (CDIAL 9191); Marathi uses it for what is most likely."
            }
          ]
        },
