            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दुरून ती टेकडी खूप जवळ भासते. durūn tī ṭekḍī khūp javaḷ bhāste. From afar that hill seems very close."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (to him …): त्याला भासलं, tyālā bhāslaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal; in speech वाटणे. Also with the dative: मला तसं भासलं."
            }
          ]
        },
